<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark FRN.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    22.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     1/16 PCT  PAY DATE    22.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.18    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT REG   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	IHS SERIES 237</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
